    "title": "Bedford 12U Baseball Team Raffles Signed Boston Celtics Basketball to Support Cooperstown Trip - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Bedford Citizen ,\n16 hours ago As part of their fundraising efforts for a tournament at the Cooperstown All Star Village Tournament in Oneonta, N.Y., a Bedford 12-and-under baseball team is offering a raffle for a signed 2025-2026 Boston Celtics team basketball. The ball comes with a certificate of authenticity from the Boston Celtics Shamrock Foundation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
